<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="447925342"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1172839893"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Meant To Be"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Arc North / Krista Marina"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Meant To Be"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:28.352"><div begin="00:00.548" end="03:24.166"><p begin="00:00.548" end="00:05.517" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">I want you to show me how to get to know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要你告诉我</span></p><p begin="00:05.954" end="00:10.219" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Someone like you, someone like you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一个像你一样的人</span></p><p begin="00:10.219" end="00:14.387" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">I want you to know me 'cause I know then you'll see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要你了解我</span></p><p begin="00:15.075" end="00:19.343" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">We can be true, we can be true<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们之间会成真</span></p><p begin="00:19.343" end="00:23.606" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">I want you to see what I see in us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要你看到 我眼中的我们</span></p><p begin="00:24.283" end="00:28.473" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Something so real, something so real<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此真挚 如此真挚</span></p><p begin="00:28.473" end="00:33.004" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">I want you to see that this is a love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要你看到 这是一份</span></p><p begin="00:33.426" end="00:38.079" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">That we both feel, that we both feel<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都感受到的爱</span></p><p begin="00:38.477" end="00:42.733" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">And how will we ever know if the love will ever grow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们如何会知晓</span></p><p begin="00:42.733" end="00:47.258" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Without trying, without trying?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无需任何努力</span></p><p begin="00:47.564" end="00:51.499" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">And how will we ever see if we are meant to be?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而我们又如何会知道</span></p><p begin="00:51.499" end="00:56.117" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">It's terrifying, it's terrifying<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这让人害怕</span></p><p begin="01:04.611" end="01:07.201" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">That we're meant to be<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们是命中注定的这个事实</span></p><p begin="01:09.344" end="01:13.396" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">We are, we are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们</span></p><p begin="01:14.333" end="01:15.927" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">We're meant to be<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">命中注定就要一起</span></p><p begin="01:22.882" end="01:25.402" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">That we're meant to be<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们是命中注定的</span></p><p begin="01:27.478" end="01:30.345" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">We are, we are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们</span></p><p begin="01:30.345" end="01:32.212" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">We're meant to be<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">命中注定就要一起</span></p><p begin="01:33.256" end="01:37.262" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">We've both been there before, when a love shuts the door<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都到了那一步</span></p><p begin="01:37.262" end="01:41.709" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">It's a losing game, it's a losing game<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这场游戏注定要输</span></p><p begin="01:41.709" end="01:46.009" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">But this time it's more than another love war<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是这次</span></p><p begin="01:46.346" end="01:50.389" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">But this ain't the same, this ain't the same<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这前所未有</span></p><p begin="01:50.389" end="01:55.104" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">They say love heals all, it makes it all alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们说爱能治愈所有</span></p><p begin="01:55.765" end="02:00.294" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">In time, in time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那时</span></p><p begin="02:00.571" end="02:03.056" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">My heart still feels the breaking<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心仍然痛着</span></p><p begin="02:02.938" end="02:04.917" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">But you make my world so bright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你照亮了我的世界</span></p><p begin="02:04.917" end="02:09.445" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">It feels so right, it feels so right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那感觉太棒了</span></p><p begin="02:09.729" end="02:13.787" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">And how will we ever feel that what we've got is real?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们何时才能</span></p><p begin="02:13.787" end="02:18.756" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">There's no denying, there's no denying<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毋庸置疑</span></p><p begin="02:18.991" end="02:22.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">And how will we ever see if we are meant to be?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们如何才能明白</span></p><p begin="02:22.930" end="02:27.832" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">It's terrifying, it's terrifying<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这让人害怕</span></p><p begin="02:28.056" end="02:32.278" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">And how will we ever know if the love will ever grow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们如何才能知道</span></p><p begin="02:32.331" end="02:36.863" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">Without trying, without trying?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无需任何努力</span></p><p begin="02:37.300" end="02:41.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">And how will we ever see if we are meant to be?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而我们又如何能够知道</span></p><p begin="02:41.250" end="02:45.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">It's terrifying, it's terrifying<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这让人害怕</span></p><p begin="02:54.294" end="02:57.098" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">That we're meant to be<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们是命中注定的这个事实</span></p><p begin="02:59.205" end="03:02.997" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">We are, we are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们</span></p><p begin="03:03.987" end="03:05.925" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">We're meant to be<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们命中注定就要一起</span></p><p begin="03:12.600" end="03:15.284" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">That we're meant to be<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们命中注定就要一起</span></p><p begin="03:17.211" end="03:20.851" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">We are, we are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们</span></p><p begin="03:22.378" end="03:24.166" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">We're meant to be<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们命中注定就要一起</span></p></div></body></tt>